      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-06-09_WidnesExaminer_art0047" n="art0047">
        <head>Bonnsstir Matrbantg, &amp;r.</head>
        <p>Bonnsstir Matrbantg, &amp;r.</p>
