        <p>, Local Branches of BOOTS Cash Chemists : WARRINGTON : 35. BRIDGE STREET. 5, BRIDGE- STREET AND MARKET GATE. STOCKPOBT :-26. BRIDGE-STREET BROW. ALTRINCIIIM :-37, RAILWAY-STREET: ECCLES :-58. CHUROH-STREET. ST. HELENS :-6, ORMSKIRK-STREET. CHESTER : 23, BASTGATE-ROW and 39, EASTGA.TE STREET.</p>
